## Docs: official Databricks documentation links
================================================================================

Context: The online docs named Databricks products and concepts (Unity
Catalog, SQL warehouses, Lakebase, Databricks Apps, bundles, Model Serving,
AI Gateway, Delta, service principals, secrets, PATs, MLflow, ...) without
pointing readers to the official Databricks documentation. Each target URL
was checked against docs.databricks.com (HTTP 200) before use.

Changes:

1. docs/*.md (all pages except docs/mcp.md)
