   mention of each Databricks term in each H2 section. Covered terms: Unity
   Catalog (and Unity Catalog volumes), Lakeflow Jobs, Lakebase, Databricks
   Apps, SQL warehouses, Model Serving, Foundation Model APIs, AI / Unity
   Gateway, Delta Lake, liquid clustering, serverless compute, personal access
   tokens, service principals, Databricks secrets, Databricks SQL Connector,
   Databricks SDK, Catalog Explorer, Databricks CLI, MLflow, Declarative
   Automation Bundles (formerly Asset Bundles), and AI/BI dashboards.
   Headings, the TOC, code spans, existing links and diagrams were left
   untouched, so anchors and the generated TOC do not change.
2. Links were not added to docs/mcp.md: it already has uncommitted content
   edits from another change and is left as is.

