   - Re-exports the two default constants.
3. src/shared/fastapi/ui_branding.py
   - `render_ui_branding_css_vars` emits `--db-btn-primary`, `-hover`, `-on`,
     `--db-btn-secondary`, `-border`, `-hover` into `#uiBrandingTokens`.
4. src/back/objects/session/GlobalConfigService.py
   - Persists `button_primary_color` / `button_secondary_color` in `ui_branding`;
     `_empty()` defaults updated.
5. src/back/objects/domain/settings/WorkspaceUiSettings.py
