================================================================================

Context: The user avatar colour is set to the Databricks workspace user-icon
colour rgb(67, 74, 147). The Activity icon moves one step left, before the
app switcher (9-dot).

Changes:

1. src/front/static/global/css/main.css
   - New root token `--db-user-avatar-bg: rgb(67, 74, 147)` (next to the
     status tokens).
   - `.ob-user-avatar` background uses `var(--db-user-avatar-bg)`, white text.
2. src/front/templates/base.html
   - Activity Center `<li>` moved from after the Back-to-context link to
     before the app switcher block. Visible order on a context page is now:
     Context · Close/Save · Activity · App switcher · Back-to-context (settings)
     · User.
3. Contract tests updated for the new order (the old order was pinned):
   - tests/units/front/test_app_switcher_contract.py
   - tests/units/front/test_segmented_subnav_contract.py
   - tests/units/front/test_settings_subnav_hidden.py (return link now checked
     before the user menu, not before Activity)
   - tests/units/front/test_workspace_home_contract.py
   - tests/units/front/test_no_backend_ui.py
   - tests/units/front/test_backend_brand_icons.py
   - Menu slices now end at `userMenuDropdown` (Activity precedes the switcher).
4. tests/units/front/test_user_menu_contract.py
   - Asserts the avatar uses `--db-user-avatar-bg` with the rgb value.

