## Navbar: Save and Close icons
================================================================================

Context: The navbar Save and Close actions used bi-cloud-upload and bi-x-circle.
No Databricks icon asset is available in the repo and the Databricks page
could not be read (Okta), so the closest Bootstrap Icons were chosen:
bi-floppy for Save and bi-x-lg for Close. Swap the names here if exact
Databricks icons are supplied.

Changes:

1. src/front/config/menu_config.json
   - Domain `navbar_actions` → Save: `bi-cloud-upload` → `bi-floppy`.
   - Domain `navbar_actions` → Close: `bi-x-circle` → `bi-x-lg`.
   The in-modal "Save & Close" buttons (navbar.js) are unchanged.

